# free CARTO API key for the map's basemap tiles - CARTO started requiring
# one on the raster tile endpoints (basemaps.cartocdn.com) from 26 Aug 2026.
# grab one free (no card, no CARTO account) at https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey
# - just an email + domain + a one-line description, instant, 5,000,000
# tiles/month free. copy this file to .env.local and paste the real key in -
# .env.local is already gitignored, this .env.example file is the only one
# that's tracked in the repo
VITE_CARTO_API_KEY=